  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Financial Management (PFM) Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cambodia Trust Fund (TF) for Public Finance Management (PFM) and Service Delivery aims to be a catalyst for the Government of Cambodia&apos;s (RGC) four-phase PFM Reform Program (PFMRP) to strengthen PFM and public service delivery performance. The USD3.75million TF promotes effective governance. The TF is administered by the World Bank and is used to finance PFM reform activities including:
a)	enhancing domestic revenue mobilization
b)	strengthening budgeting, planning, and expenditure management
c)	implementing performance systems for enhanced service delivery
d)	supporting innovation, monitoring, coordination, communication, and capacity building.</narrative>
  </description>
